# Jr's Quest plays itself: the whole game as a show, from the date prompt
# to the ending. Every room, every character, all nine parts that didn't
# change, two deaths, 158 of 158. This file is the source; tools/mkwalk.mjs
# plays it and writes the two scripts:
#   node tools/mkwalk.mjs build test/showcase.src test/showcase.txt --demo game/demo/1.txt
# test/showcase.txt has expect lines and is what the tests run.
# game/demo/1.txt is the same without them: "Let the AI play" on the title.
# pace: a box stays up 12 cycles + 1 per 2 characters; one typed character
# a cycle; 4 cycles of thought before typing.
pace 12 2 1 4
# ---- Act 0: the date prompt, the title, the opening ----
10
expect Current date is Tue
slowtype 10-05-26
12
expect Invalid date
slowtype 10-05-2026
30
expect Let the AI play
